WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.853
Standing up a deployment.

2
00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.859
The first launch asks for one thing: the owner account,

3
00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:11.001
and the first unit you will lead.

4
00:00:12.203 --> 00:00:14.764
The Owner console runs the deployment:

5
00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:18.201
settings, accounts, units, retention and backups.

6
00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:21.945
Decide the settings before anyone else signs in,

7
00:00:21.945 --> 00:00:25.613
starting with whether people may register themselves.

8
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:28.322
Build the chain of command.

9
00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:30.676
Teams sit under their command,

10
00:00:30.676 --> 00:00:33.674
and authority flows down, never up.

11
00:00:34.224 --> 00:00:38.409
Then bring people in: an invitation they accept themselves,

12
00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:41.206
or accounts imported from a roster.
